{
  "key": "letter-145-part-01",
  "number": 145,
  "generationId": "01a1e6d6-32d9-737c-994c-5d0448c986bc",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.664875
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Atheism is the first step towards theism, and a must.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/02.mp3",
      "start": 2.1251469999999997,
      "end": 6.0161
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "If you haven't been through the fire of atheism you'll never know the light of theism.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/03.mp3",
      "start": 7.507778,
      "end": 12.027097999999999
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "If you haven't the true strength to say No your Yes will always be impotent.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/04.mp3",
      "start": 13.482744,
      "end": 18.37576
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "So I am glad you are an atheist - something that can be said only by a theist.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/05.mp3",
      "start": 19.854308,
      "end": 24.338594
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "So I say: Go deeper into atheism.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/06.mp3",
      "start": 25.419297,
      "end": 28.011156
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Superficiality won't do, so don't just think atheism, live it - and it will ultimately lead you to God.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/07.mp3",
      "start": 29.132585,
      "end": 34.800498999999995
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Atheism isn't it, it is just a doubting.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/08.mp3",
      "start": 35.875170000000004,
      "end": 38.692811999999996
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Doubt is good but it isn't it.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/09.mp3",
      "start": 40.284286,
      "end": 42.269478
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Actually, doubt is a search for trust.",
      "path": "audio/1970-145/10.mp3",
      "start": 43.798254,
      "end": 46.84
    }
  ]
}
